{"G1303":{"id":"G1303","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1303","disambiguated_id":"G1303 =","unique_id":"G1303","headword":"διατίθημι","transliteration":"diatithēmi","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to make a covenant","definition_en":"δια-τίθημι \n [in LXX chiefly for כָּרַת, frequently δ. διαθήκην (כָּרַת) ;] \nto place separately, arrange, dispose. Mid, only in NT; \n __1. (a) in general, to dispose of; with dative of person(s), to assign to one, Luk.22:29; \n __(b) to dispose of by a will, make a testament (in cl., δ. διαθήκην also in this sense): Heb.9:16-17 (but cf. R, mg., and see: διαθήκη). \n __2. δ. διαθήκην, to make a covenant (Aristoph.): with dative of person(s), Heb.8:10 (LXX); before πρ, with accusative of person(s), Act.3:25, Heb.10:16\" (LXX) (cf. ἀντι-διατίθημι).†\n (AS)","source_line":1435}],"occurrence_count":7,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"farei","count":4},{"gloss":"testador","count":2},{"gloss":"determino","count":1}]},"G1565":{"id":"G1565","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1565","disambiguated_id":"G1565 =","unique_id":"G1565","headword":"ἐκεῖνος","transliteration":"ekeinos","lexical_morphology":"G:D","gloss_en":"that","definition_en":"ἐκεῖνος, -η, -ο \n (ἐκεῖ), [in LXX chiefly for הַהוּא ,הוּא, and cogn. forms ;] \n demonstr. pron., \nthat person or thing (ille), implying remoteness as compared with οὗτος (hic); \n__1. absol., emphatic he, she, it: opposite to οὗτος, Luk.18:14, Jas.4:15; ἡμεῖς, Heb.12:25; ὑμεῖς, Mrk.4:11; ἄλλοι, Jhn.9:9; ἐγώ, Jhn.3:30; to persons named, Mk 16:[10, 13, 20], Jhn.2:21; of one (absent) who is not named, contemptuously (Abbott, JG, §§2385, 2732), Jhn.7:11 9:28; with respect, of Christ, 1Jo.2:6 3:3, al.; referring to a preceding noun, Mrk.16:[10], Jhn.7:45; resumption of a participial subject, Jhn.1:33 9:37 10:1, Rom.14:14, al. (on its reference in Jhn.19:35, see Westc, in l.; Moffatt, Intr., 568; Sanday, Fourth Gospel, 77ff.). \n __2. As adj., joined, like οὗτος, to a noun with the article: Mat.7:25, Mrk.3:24, Jhn.18:15, al.; esp. of time, past or future: ἐν τ. ἡμέραις ἐ., Mat.3:1, Mrk.1:9, Act.2:18\" (LXX), al.; ἐν ἐ. τ. ἡμέρᾳ, esp of the Parousia, Mat.7:22, Luk.6:23, 2Th.1:10, 2Ti.1:12; adverbially, ἐκεινής (sc. ὁδοῦ) = cl. ἐκεινῇ (Bl., §36, 13), that way, Luk.19:4.\n (AS)","source_line":1705}],"occurrence_count":242,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"ele","count":50},{"gloss":"aqueles","count":30},{"gloss":"naquele","count":29},{"gloss":"aquela","count":27},{"gloss":"aquele","count":27},{"gloss":"dele","count":17},{"gloss":"naqueles","count":16},{"gloss":"ela","count":9},{"gloss":"daquela","count":7},{"gloss":"neles","count":7},{"gloss":"esse","count":6},{"gloss":"naquela","count":5},{"gloss":"daqueles","count":2},{"gloss":"deles","count":2},{"gloss":"daquele","count":2},{"gloss":"aquilo","count":1},{"gloss":"aquelas","count":1},{"gloss":"isso","count":1},{"gloss":"elas","count":1},{"gloss":"eles","count":1},{"gloss":"delas","count":1}]},"G1596":{"id":"G1596","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1596","disambiguated_id":"G1596 =","unique_id":"G1596","headword":"ἑκουσίως","transliteration":"hekousiōs","lexical_morphology":"G:ADV / G:A","gloss_en":"voluntarily","definition_en":"ἑκουσίως \n adv., [in LXX: Psa.54:6 (נְדָבָה) 2Ma.14:3, al. ;] \nvoluntarily, willingly: Heb.10:26, 1Pe.5:2.†\n (AS)","source_line":1736}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"havermos","count":1},{"gloss":"voluntariamente","count":1}]},"G1913":{"id":"G1913","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G1913","disambiguated_id":"G1913 =","unique_id":"G1913","headword":"ἐπιβιβάζω","transliteration":"epibibazō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to mount","definition_en":"ἐπι-βιβάζω \n [in LXX chiefly for רָכַב hi. ;] \nto place upon: with accusative of person(s), Luk.10:34 19:35, Act.23:24.†\n (AS)","source_line":2054}],"occurrence_count":3,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"colocando","count":1},{"gloss":"fizeram-montar",